{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>--- Fail, learn, and conquer!---</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to control, but brutally difficult!? <br><br>A die-and-retry 2D action game has arrived!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This tower is packed with deadly traps and surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the three powers of <strong>Fire, Ice, and Wind</strong> to conquer every stage(33stage) and aim for an <strong>S rank!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How many times will you fall before you succeed...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fail, learn, and conquer!</strong><br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592860/extras/5.png?t=1742743546\" /><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you can beat the game without any prior knowledge and without a single mistake,<br>you\u2019re either a true psychic or have godlike reflexes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let us know on <strong>Clover Soft\u2019s X (Twitter)!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u></u></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592860?t=1742743546","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592860?t=1742743546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592860/62fa5b3db3c8fd4c1c9de25bb1f3032d02ea9ee2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742743546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592860/62fa5b3db3c8fd4c1c9de25bb1f3032d02ea9ee2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742743546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3598800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"b